==Evaluation==
;Pros
*Resilient to [[elemental damage]] due to [[Basic armor|Ranger armor]].
*Has several [[interrupt]]ion skills.
*Can inflict [[Dazed]].

;Cons
*Cannot prioritize which [[skill]]s to interrupt.
*Poor [[energy management]].
*Has no defensive [[stance]]s.
*Deals little skill based [[damage]].
*Will activate Read the Wind whenever it ends, even when the [[party]] is being attacked.
*Outside the Raisu Palace and Imperial Sanctum missions, he only has 7 skills equipped.

